:: Street Approach Widgets [widget]

<<widget "streetapproach">>
	<<set $approach_resist to 1>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $NPCList[0].skills.security += (1000 - $submissive) / 4>>

	<span class="purple">Suddenly, a <<person>> approaches.</span><br>
	<<cheesy-pickup-line>>
	<br><br>

	<<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000 "silent">><<set _hasPromiscuity to 0>>
    <<if hasSexStat("promiscuity",2)>>
        <<set _hasPromiscuity to 1>>
        <<link [[Smile (0:10)|Street Approach Flirt]]>><<pass 10>><<handheldon>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
    <<else>>
        <span class="blue">You're not promiscuous enough to reciprocate.</span>
    <</if>>
    <br>
	<<if (($arousal lt $arousalmax * 3/5 or (!$statFreeze and !$hc and $arousalDesensitizedTrait is 1) or (typeof activeInsanityTrait === "function" and activeInsanityTrait())) and effectiveDrunk() lt 240) or !_hasPromiscuity>>
		<<link [[Reject (0:01)|Street Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<<elseif $willpowerSuccess>>
		<<link [[Reject (0:01)|Street Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 1>><<willpowersuccess>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $approach_resist to 0>>
		<span class="lewd">You're too <<= (!((!$statFreeze and !$hc and $arousalDesensitizedTrait is 1)) and !(typeof activeInsanityTrait === "function" and activeInsanityTrait()) and $arousal gte $arousalmax * 3/5)? "horny" : "drunk">> to resist <<his>> advances.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

:: Street Approach Flirt
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<promiscuity2>>
You smile as <<he>> approaches, encouraging <<him>> to continue.
<br><br>

<<chitchat>> You both chat along on the street for a few minutes, happily enjoying eachothers company. 
<br><br>

"You know, you really are quite a <<= $player.gender_appearance is "f" ? ["sexy chick", "hot girl", "hot babe", "sex bomb", "sweet piece of tail"].random() : ["handsome guy", "sexy hunk of ass", "hot stud", "stallion"].random()>>," <<he>> says. <<He>> leans forward and touches your <<=$player.sex is "f"?"waist":"chest">> in a flirty way. "<<= $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500? "" : "H-">>How about going somewhere more... private?"
<br><br>

<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
<<case "meek">>
	"S-Sure..." you answer in a small voice, already picturing everything <<he>> could do to you in the alley. The thought makes you nervous, or perhaps it is exactly why you are nervous, but you follow <<him>> into the nearby alley anyway.
<<case "shy">>
	"S-Sure..." you answer, glancing away. You picture everything <<he>> could do to you in the alley, and the thought makes you flustered, but you follow <<him>> into the nearby alley anyway.
<<case "polite">>
	"I'd like that, thank you," you say with a small smile. You are already thinking about what might happen once you are alone, and you follow <<him>> into the nearby alley.
<<case "confident">>
	"Then let's go," you say, and take <<his>> hand. "I know what I want." The <<person>> hesitates for a moment, then follows you into the nearby alley.
<<case "bratty">>
	"We better get going, then," you say with a cheeky smile. "This <<= $player.gender_appearance is "f" ? "girl" : ($player.gender_appearance is "m" ? "boy" : "person") >> isn't gonna service <<pherself stranger>>." The <<persons>> stunned by your boldness for a few moments. After shaking off <<his>> shock, <<he>> follows you into the nearby alley, against <<his>> better judgement.
<<case "docile">>
	"Yes... I'll go wherever you want," you say, lowering your eyes. You follow <<him>> into the nearby alley and wait for <<him>> to tell you what to do.
<<case "flamboyant">>
	"I'd like that, thank you," you say with a small smile. You are already thinking about what might happen once you are alone, and you follow <<him>> into the nearby alley.
<<case "cruel">>
	"Then stop talking and move," you say, looking <<him>> up and down. "I don't like waiting." The <<person>> looks unsure, but follows you into the nearby alley anyway.
<<default>>
	"I thought you'd never ask," you say, pretending to be surprised. "Come on, let's go." You don't need long to decide, so you follow <<him>> into the nearby alley.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Street Approach Flirt 2]]>><</link>>

:: Street Approach Flirt 2

<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500>>
	<<He>> doesn't look around or slow down. With steady confidence, <<he>> guides you deeper into the alley, past the bins and the back doors, as if <<he>> already knew a spot where nobody would see you. When <<he>> finally stops, it is behind a corner that neither end of the alley can see.
	<br><br>
	No longer able to restrain <<himself>>, the <<person>> lunges at you, and begins to grope you all over.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (0:10)|Street Approach Sex]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> stops at the mouth of the alley and glances up and down the street, then checks the alley itself, clearly unsure of <<himself>>. <<He>> tries one corner, frowns when a window overlooks it, and moves a few steps further, glancing back over <<his>> shoulder every time you move. Once <<he>> finds a spot that feels safe enough, <<he>> lets out a breath and beckons you over.
    <br><br>
	No longer able to control <<himself>>, the <<person>> lunges at you, cornering you against a wall, and begins to grope you all over with panting lust.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (0:10)|Street Approach Sex]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Street Approach Sex

