:: Street Approach Sex Finish

<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
		<<tearful>> you knock <<him>> into a nearby pile of rubbish, which collapses under <<his>> weight.
		<br><br>
		As <<he>> struggles to get back on <<his>> feet, you take the chance to dash out into the street, ignoring anything you might have left behind.

	<<elseif $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
		<<ejaculation>>
		<<clotheson>>

		<<He>> collapses over you. "You really are the best slut in town," <<he>> says, stroking your hair. "Let's keep this between the two of us, though."

		<<He>> glances at <<his>> watch. "I gotta go. Pleasure meeting you."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> hastily dresses back up before rushing back into the street, leaving you feeling a bit used. <<tearful>> you dress back up before heading out yourself.

	<<else>>
		<<clotheson>>
		<<if $finish is 1>><<encounterEndViolence>><</if>>
		"Alright, alright. I knew I was out of practice." You stare at <<him>> as <<he>> starts gathering <<his>> things. "Fuck, just go!"
		<br><br>
		<<tearful>> you quickly gather your clothes and get dressed before heading out.
	<</if>>

	<br><br>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<destinationeventend>>

<<else>>
	<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
		<<tearful>> you knock <<him>> into a nearby pile of rubbish, which collapses under <<his>> weight.
		<br><br>
		As <<he>> struggles to get back on <<his>> feet, you take the chance to dash out into the street, ignoring anything you might have left behind.

	<<elseif $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
		<<ejaculation>>
		<<clotheson>>

		<<He>> collapses over you. "That was amazing," <<he>> pants. "You really are an incredible <<= $player.gender_appearance is "f" ? "girl" : ($player.gender_appearance is "m" ? "guy" : "person") >>."

		<<He>> lifts <<himself>> up, trying to get a better look at you in the dark alley. "Honestly, I'd love for you to come home with me. Can I tempt you with some coffee? Maybe tea?"
		<br><br>
		You tell <<him>> there's no need for it and that you really should be going.
		<br><br>
		"Name's <<personname>>," <<he>> suddenly introduces <<himself>> out of the blue, as if hoping this was more than just some fling. "I really hope we can see each other again."
		<br><br>
		You quickly get dressed, apologising for not being able to stay. <<tearful>> you leave the alley while <<he>> watches you go.

	<<else>>
		<<clotheson>>
		<<if $finish is 1>><<encounterEndViolence>><</if>>
		"Huh? What's wrong?" <<he>> asks. "Ugh, never mind. This was a mistake. Please leave."
		<br><br>
		<<tearful>> you leave <<him>> in peace.
	<</if>>

	<br><br>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<</if>>


:: Street Approach Reject
<<if $phase is 1>>
	Unimpressed, you shoot down every one of <<his>> poor attempts at a pick-up line. You are almost embarrassed that <<he>> thought such cheesy lines would work on you. And somehow, <<he>> still looks shocked that <<his>> clever one-liners missed their mark.
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500>>
		"Come on! Don't be like that!" <<he>> protests. "Let's have some fun! I'll make you feel good."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Relent (0:20)|Street Approach Flirt]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
        <br>
        <<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000 "silent">>
        <<if ($arousal lt $arousalmax * 3/5 or (!$statFreeze and !$hc and $arousalDesensitizedTrait is 1) or (typeof activeInsanityTrait === "function" and activeInsanityTrait())) and effectiveDrunk() lt 240>>
            <<link [[Refuse again|Street Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
        <<elseif $willpowerSuccess and $approach_resist>>
            <<link [[Refuse again|Street Approach Reject]]>><<willpowersuccess>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
        <<else>>
            <<set $approach_resist to 0>>
            <<He>> has worn you down. <span class="lewd">You're now going along with <<his>> advances</span>.
        <</if>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		Having run out of ammunition, the <<person>> takes <<his>> leave feeling defeated.
		<br><br>
        <<destinationeventend>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Despite <<his>> pushiness, you still refuse every attempt <<he>> makes to get you to cave.
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 750>>
		For a moment it seems the <<persons>> about to lose <<his>> temper, but the disapproving looks of the onlookers seem to scare <<him>> off.
		<br><br>
		With a scornful expression, <<he>> clicks <<his>> tongue one last time before leaving.
	<<else>>
		Having knocked out the wind out of <<his>> sails, <<he>> makes one last scornful remark before going off.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
    <<destinationeventend>>
<</if>>
